# Two ports report the same group. The row carries both and goes only when
# the last one is gone: port 1 leaves (timed leave), its share lapses, the row
# keeps port 2 and the PON (0x2 + 0x4); port 2 stops reporting and the row is
# removed when its membership interval (260 s from its report) runs out.
0 policy
snooping=1
igmp_function=0
immediate_leave=0
end
0 tick
1 v2join 1 0 192.168.1.10 239.1.1.1
3 v2join 2 0 192.168.1.11 239.1.1.1
10 v2leave 1 0 192.168.1.10 239.1.1.1
11 tick
12 tick
13 state
262 tick
263 tick
264 state
